<sys:String x:Key="LOCBackgroundStretchMode">Stretch backgrounds to fill the screen</sys:String>
<sys:String x:Key="LOCBackgroundStretchModeDesc">Uses Fill instead of UniformToFill for game backgrounds. This has little to no noticeable effect on 16:9 images, but images with a different aspect ratio will be stretched to fit the entire screen instead of being zoomed and cropped. This is an advanced setting; leave it disabled if you are unsure what it does.</sys:String>

