<sys:String x:Key="LOCOpacityShadeLeft">Left Black Fade Opacity</sys:String>
<sys:String x:Key="LOCOpacityShadeLeftDesc">Adjusts the opacity of the dark fade on the left side of the main view, improving the readability of game logos. 0 is fully transparent, 1 is fully opaque.</sys:String>

<sys:String x:Key="LOCOpacityShadeBottom">Bottom Black Fade Opacity</sys:String>
<sys:String x:Key="LOCOpacityShadeBottomDesc">Adjusts the opacity of the dark fade at the bottom of the main view, improving the readability of the game list and the information displayed above it. 0 is fully transparent, 1 is fully opaque.</sys:String>

