<sys:String x:Key="LOCShowMusicPlayerButtonDesc">Shows or hides the Music Player button in the top bar.</sys:String>

<sys:String x:Key="LOCShowOverlayButton">Show Overlay Button</sys:String>
<sys:String x:Key="LOCShowOverlayButtonDesc">Shows or hides the in-game overlay button in the top bar.</sys:String>

<sys:String x:Key="LOCStretchBanner">Banner Stretch Mode</sys:String>
<sys:String x:Key="LOCStretchBannerDesc">Stretches banners displayed on or above game covers so the entire image remains visible instead of being centered and cropped. Useful for custom banners with platform names or logos positioned near the left or right edges.</sys:String>

